      "value": "This was something I was waiting for the instant I saw that I could build worlds in VRChat. Since it is not possible to load a world while offline and the loading of external data is limitted to 1 source every 5 seconds. And the exporting of data right now is only possible using http GETs. I would totally love this flexibility.\n\nI like this idea, although I do see why this would be dangerous. For example, you could obtain the user's IP in this way, which is a security risk. And the payload on such worlds would not be sanctioned nor verifiable. \n\nBut I would totally like the flexibility, even if it is limited under a trust requirement.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
