      "value": "@{655295578b71451a01751692|full_name}\n\n>per-world option of \"Allow Untrusted Url\" toggle\n\nI would prefer if it was per-host (domain/IP) instead of per-world. There might be cases were a WebSocket service might be hosted by the instance owner instead of the world creator.\n\nPS. In general I would like more control of which hosts VRChat could connect to in general instead of either allowing only a restricted number of hosts or allowing everything (which might leak my IP), but that's an another suggestion.",
